            </note>
            <note corresp="#d282-f2" n="44" xml:id="d282-f2-content">
                <p>The bin was passed by a vote of 323 yeas, 71 nays (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Congressional Record</hi>, Apr. 12, 1924, p. 6257).</p>
            </note>
